# merge：被合并分支是当前分支祖先，零改动
> init
<<<

# master 提交基线，建 other 停在此处
+ base.txt mbase.txt
> add base.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# master 再追加一次提交，other 成为 master 的祖先
+ extra.txt mcur.txt
> add extra.txt
<<<
> commit "master ahead"
<<<

# 合并祖先分支：只打印消息，不动状态
> merge other
Given branch is an ancestor of the current branch.
<<<

# 工作区两文件都在，内容不变
= base.txt mbase.txt
= extra.txt mcur.txt
